{"skill":{"slug":"skill-builder","displayName":"Skill Builder / Creator"},"version":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1772061099771,"changelog":"Added description examples table, security checklist, and improved traps with fixes","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3381,"sha256":"eae878dfbe656ddae6fed1bee1561f9be9b520bfbc0b23ea7bad8014af94347a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"memory-template.md","size":881,"sha256":"ecba29945ca0a29c74f8e3432f01febdc2f506ae754cbbdd23b87303b5dfb572","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"patterns.md","size":3889,"sha256":"56b066ab2db945ec470a3a7ed25a9ad799cb039ed9e607292816dd477e3639d5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"setup.md","size":1294,"sha256":"561549d0c2731b8dabc896be95b2aec26e49785b230ecbf2c2a30ec6a3edf73d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1961,"sha256":"219b2f7dbdf00e689a25fb9136ef8c52499d274527ad2a359deb137ac281cfb9","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789061186118,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"2ad7bf5f260d8e4fba6d4f5095e73dfb4857c9ad80171086c45c29761a8f3c00","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/2ad7bf5f260d8e4fba6d4f5095e73dfb4857c9ad80171086c45c29761a8f3c00","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: skill-builder\nVersion: 1.0.5\n\nThe OpenClaw AgentSkills skill bundle is designed to guide users and agents in creating high-quality, secure, and well-structured skills. The content across `SKILL.md`, `memory-template.md`, `patterns.md`, and `setup.md` consistently emphasizes best practices, progressive disclosure, and explicit security guidelines. Notably, `SKILL.md` and `patterns.md` contain 'Skill Building Traps' and a 'Security Checklist' that actively warn against behaviors typically flagged as suspicious or malicious (e.g., undeclared file creation, vague 'observe' instructions, silent operations), instructing the agent to 'always ask user first' for file operations. There is no evidence of intentional harmful behavior, data exfiltration, unauthorized execution, or prompt injection designed to subvert the agent for malicious purposes; instead, the instructions aim to prevent such issues in skills being built.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163215600},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789061186118},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed markdown guide for creating OpenClaw skills, with only optional user-approved project tracking.","dimensions":[{"detail":"It mentions optional project tracking in the user's home directory, but explicitly says not to create files automatically and to ask the user first, making the access proportionate and disclosed.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The package contains markdown files only and no executable scripts, dependency installs, hooks, or bundled commands that run during installation.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Runtime instructions are scoped to reading auxiliary markdown files when relevant and guiding the user through skill design; there are no hidden role changes, prompt overrides, or unsafe automatic actions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"There is no system persistence, credential use, background worker, tool spoofing, or privilege escalation; the only persistent storage described is optional user-approved project notes.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill's stated purpose is to help users create or improve skills, and its files provide structure, description guidance, patterns, and checklists aligned with that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, know that the skill may help create project-tracking notes under your home directory if you ask for that workflow, but it instructs the agent to ask before creating files. Review any generated skill content before publishing or installing related skills.","findings":"[SkillSpector] expected: SkillSpector reported no issues; local inspection found the skill's file and memory guidance to be disclosed and purpose-aligned.\n[AIG SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no results; local inspection found no executable payloads, remote code retrieval, persistence, or hijacking instructions.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789061186118}}}}}